comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T14:52:34.772Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced the exact operational entry-point failure on the Dependabot head: the committed launcher hash differs from the archive hash. The launcher was already changed in commit 259703b without an archive refresh. This is a stale consumer snapshot, not a pm-ops, pm-cli, or pm-changelog regression. Regenerate the archive; preserve source and every assertion. Auto-merge disabled to retain the requested review boundary."
  "2026-10-23T14:56:40.822Z",codex-agent,"After regenerating the archive, the unchanged operational entry-point regression passes: 1 test, 0 failures/skips. The original archive fails with the committed launcher hash mismatch, establishing the behavioral revert proof. Regenerated changelog is unchanged because this tracking item remains in progress. Full npm/Bun gates and exact-head CI are next."
  "2026-10-23T16:31:37.272Z",codex-agent,Refreshing PR 137 with origin/main in one standard two-parent merge commit. Only selfhost.bundle conflicts; regenerate with the repository writer after tracker and changelog updates. Package manifests merged cleanly and retain the higher pm-toolchain versions. No production functions are changed by this maintenance; existing exact-gates regressions provide the behavioral audit proof.
  "2026-10-23T16:46:31.884Z",codex-agent,"Merged origin/main including PR 146. The only conflict was selfhost.bundle, regenerated by npm run self-host:write from the combined tracked tree. package.json and package-lock.json merged cleanly; every differing shared dependency retains the higher PR version, and npm install --package-lock-only completed without changes or vulnerabilities. CHANGELOG.md was regenerated without a content change. Committed self-host verification, the operational regression, and the full self-host/exact-gates suite passed locally. Full npm and Bun release gates are running with isolated Git identity configuration and CI-pinned Bun 1.3.14; exact-head CI will provide the final Node 22/26 receipts. No production function changed, so no new behavioral revert proof applies; existing exact-gates tests exercise stale-archive rejection. Tracker health passes with the CI-pinned pm-github extension; existing advisory findings are outside this merge refresh."
